BANKIMPORT_Help_Title=Help
BANKIMPORT_Help_Description=This module allows importing bank statements into Dolibarr in two formats: CSV (camt.052 v8, e.g. Haspa) and XML (camt.053, e.g. Revolut Business). The format is detected automatically.
BANKIMPORT_Help_Format=Supported formats:
BANKIMPORT_Help_Format_Details=• CSV file with semicolon as separator (first line is skipped as header)<br>• XML file in ISO 20022 camt.053 format<br>• Supported CSV encodings: UTF-8, ISO-8859-1 (XML uses its own declared encoding)<br>• Maximum file size: %s<br>• Duplicate detection by import key (XML uses AcctSvcrRef when available)
